Jill is an agent of the S.T.A.R.S., a special unit of the police of Raccoon City(U.S.A) that during the middle of the year 1998 she went to attend with her team multiple cases related to disappearances and mysterious murders near the Spencer mansion, in the forest of the city.
Early on she discovers that everything was caused by the pharmaceutical corporation Umbrella, because they are dedicated to the manufacture of various types of viruses, which turn the infected from typical zombies to true formless abominations.
She managed to escape from the company's facilities but a virus, specifically the T version, escaped from the mansion's laboratory and managed to spread throughout the city.
Again she managed to escape, this time while the city was collapsing and being chased by an enhanced monster called Nemesis, sent by Umbrella themselves to silence her.
Now she lies walking alone on one of the roads that connected to the city but sees how a tranquilizer dart hits her shoulder and knocks her unconscious.
